Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "PH",
    "trade": "woven sisal baskets",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "JPY"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer–seller chat",
      "text": "8 April 2025\n09:10 Mina: Hello, can you make four woven sisal baskets for me?\n09:14 Tala: Yes. I can offer four natural sisal baskets, each about 25 cm wide, with loop handles.\n09:17 Mina: That size works. Please keep the weave natural, without dye.\n09:20 Tala: The total is JPY 8,400, including shipping from the Philippines. I can send a PayPal invoice.\n09:23 Mina: Agreed. Please invoice me as Mina. I will pay in JPY.\n09:26 Tala: Thank you, Mina. I will pack the baskets together and let you know when they are booked with the courier."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller's invoice",
      "text": "Invoice date: 8 April 2025\nSeller: Tala\nBuyer: Mina\nCurrency: JPY\n\nFour natural woven sisal baskets, approximately 25 cm wide, with loop handles\n4 × JPY 1,800 = JPY 7,200\nShipping from the Philippines = JPY 1,200\nTotal: JPY 8,400\n\nPayment method: PayPal\nPayment due: Upon receipt\nPacking: All four baskets in one parcel\nFinish: Natural, undyed sisal\n\nThank you for your order. The baskets are handmade, so minor variations in the weave and dimensions are expected. The seller will provide shipment details after the parcel is booked."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking receipt",
      "text": "Courier booking confirmation\nCarrier: DHL Express\nBooking date: 11 April 2025\nSender: Tala, Philippines\nRecipient: Mina\nContents: Four woven sisal baskets\nPackages: One carton\nService: International parcel delivery\nDeclared currency: JPY\nDeclared goods value: JPY 7,200\n\nThe parcel was accepted for dispatch. The tracking number appears only on the separate waybill, which is not included with this booking receipt. Retain the waybill for shipment updates and any delivery enquiries. The goods value above excludes the shipping charge shown on the seller's invoice."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: JPY 8,400",
      "value": "JPY 8,400"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: four woven sisal baskets",
      "value": "four woven sisal baskets"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 8 April 2025",
      "value": "8 April 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Mina",
      "value": "Mina"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking_number: tracking number of the parcel",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: DHL Express",
      "value": "DHL Express"
    }
  ]
}
